{"seq":6,"slug":"climate-adaptation-engineering","title":"气候适应工程","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"气候适应工程\">气候适应工程</h1><p>气候适应工程（Climate Adaptation Engineering）是系统性应对气候变化影响的工程技术与规划体系，旨在通过基础设施改造、生态系统管理和制度机制建设，降低人类社会对气候风险的脆弱性，增强应对极端天气事件和渐进气候变化的韧性能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适应与减缓的区别\">适应与减缓的区别</h2><p>气候行动包含两大支柱：减缓（Mitigation）与适应（Adaptation）。减缓聚焦于减少温室气体排放源头，如可再生能源替代、碳捕集封存等；适应则针对已经发生或不可避免的气候影响，通过工程、技术和管理手段降低损害。两者相辅相成——即使全球实现净零排放，由于气候系统惯性，未来数十年仍将面临持续升温和极端事件加剧，适应工程因此不可或缺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心框架\">核心框架</h2><p>气候适应工程遵循&quot;评估—规划—实施—监测&quot;的闭环框架。首先通过气候风险评估识别暴露度与脆弱性，继而制定适应规划确定优先行动，随后开展工程实施（包括灰色基础设施、绿色基础设施和制度性措施），最后通过监测评估反馈调整策略。IPCC AR6 将适应路径归纳为三类：结构性/物理性适应、社会性适应和制度性适应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全球与中国实践\">全球与中国实践</h2><p>据 UNEP《2025 适应差距报告》，发展中国家到 2035 年每年需要 3100-3650 亿美元适应资金，而 2023 年国际公共适应资金仅 260 亿美元，缺口高达 12-14 倍。截至 2025 年 9 月，全球已有 144 个国家启动国家适应计划（NAP）进程，67 个发展中国家正式提交 NAP。中国在适应领域走在前列：海绵城市建设累计投资突破 8000 亿元人民币，覆盖 30 个国家级试点城市和超过 200 个省级试点城市；《国家适应气候变化战略 2035》确立了气候韧性社会建设的顶层框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节导读\">章节导读</h2><p>本 hub 按照&quot;科学基础—城市工程—农业生态—治理融资&quot;的逻辑组织为四章：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>适应科学框架</strong>：介绍气候风险评估方法论、脆弱性与韧性理论基础、适应规划工具与决策支持系统</li>\n<li><strong>城市基础设施适应</strong>：深入海绵城市工程、热岛缓解技术、沿海防洪体系等城市尺度适应实践</li>\n<li><strong>农业与生态系统适应</strong>：覆盖气候智慧型农业、水资源适应性管理、基于生态系统的适应方案</li>\n<li><strong>适应治理与融资</strong>：解析国家适应计划制度、适应融资机制创新、损失与损害补偿体系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过四章内容的系统学习，读者将建立从科学认知到工程实践、从技术方案到制度保障的完整气候适应知识体系。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptation-science-framework","title":"适应科学框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-science-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-risk-assessment","title":"气候风险评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-science-framework/climate-risk-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vulnerability-resilience","title":"脆弱性与韧性理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-science-framework/vulnerability-resilience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptation-planning-tools","title":"适应规划工具与决策支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-science-framework/adaptation-planning-tools"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"urban-infrastructure-adaptation","title":"城市基础设施适应","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/urban-infrastructure-adaptation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sponge-city-engineering","title":"海绵城市工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/urban-infrastructure-adaptation/sponge-city-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heat-island-mitigation","title":"城市热岛缓解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/urban-infrastructure-adaptation/heat-island-mitigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coastal-flood-defense","title":"沿海防洪工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/urban-infrastructure-adaptation/coastal-flood-defense"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"agriculture-ecosystem-adaptation","title":"农业与生态系统适应","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/agriculture-ecosystem-adaptation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-smart-agriculture","title":"气候智慧型农业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/agriculture-ecosystem-adaptation/climate-smart-agriculture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"water-resource-management","title":"水资源适应性管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/agriculture-ecosystem-adaptation/water-resource-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem-based-adaptation","title":"基于生态系统的适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/agriculture-ecosystem-adaptation/ecosystem-based-adaptation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"adaptation-governance-finance","title":"适应治理与融资","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-governance-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"national-adaptation-plans","title":"国家适应计划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-governance-finance/national-adaptation-plans"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptation-finance","title":"适应融资机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-governance-finance/adaptation-finance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"loss-damage-mechanism","title":"损失与损害机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-adaptation-engineering/adaptation-governance-finance/loss-damage-mechanism"}]}]}